{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17149","headline":"春色满皇州 · 张嗣初","name":"春色满皇州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处年华好，皇州淑气匀。\n韶阳潜应律，草木暗迎春。\n柳变金堤畔，兰抽曲水滨。\n轻黄垂辇道，微绿映天津。\n丽景浮丹阙，晴光拥紫宸。\n不知幽远地，今日几枝新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张嗣初","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}